## Programmer Workflow (managed example)

Load the `programmer-workflow` skill at the start of a session. Before acting, run:

```
python "<skill-dir>/scripts/companion.py" boot --host generic --workspace .
```

Obey active memory; ask before relying on proposed entries. If memory conflicts with the current request, ask which to keep. Follow the skill's ask, stall, debugging, docs and prototype protocols.
